    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571570/extras/9130acf289e9d09aba2ce62b9d249113.poster.avif?t=1658262550\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571570/extras/9130acf289e9d09aba2ce62b9d249113.webm?t=1658262550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571570/extras/9130acf289e9d09aba2ce62b9d249113.mp4?t=1658262550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571570/extras/4201a416a19e30b56f492814f1ea6898.avif?t=1658262550\" /></div><br><br>Several young women were abducted in a London park. They have not been found again. Now the population is afraid that a serial killer is on the loose in London.<br>It was rumoured that Jack the Ripper was back. <br>Because of the big outcry and the big media presence the government was forced to start a big investigation.<br>Now, as private investigator Boris Brown, you will search the London garden for the missing girls and find out who is behind the disappearance.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571570/extras/e7edf2e370d63567e05adb5b09ddc03a.avif?t=1658262550\" /></div><br><br>Traverse the winding labyrinth and find the missing girls.<br>Solve tricky puzzles and escape the coming monsters.<br>Used the environment to move forward.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571570/extras/0101c906e38a87c592d9246759a0915d.avif?t=1658262550\" /></div><br><br>Explore the large and creepy labyrinth. Discover hidden nooks and dark corners. But be careful. Something could be hiding in the dark.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571570/extras/5670e76e79c1482bd0e26441a21f8835.avif?t=1658262550\" /></div><br>Don't be fooled. Monsters from the darkest corners of hell await you. Try not to stay in the dark for too long.",
